## **📦 Canonical Transform Cycle (Conceptual)**

```python
def forward(node):
    x = node.state_vector
    A = node.decamatrix
    x1 = A @ x
    x2 = apply_entanglement(x1, node.entanglement)
    metadata = rebuild_metadata(x2)
    return x2, metadata
```

And the inverse:

```python
def inverse(node):
    A_inv = invert(node.decamatrix)
    x1 = A_inv @ node.state_vector
    x2 = reverse_entanglement(x1, node.entanglement)
    return x2
```

This is the **canonical reversible transform pair**.

